Blobfish (Wondering): *Yaaawn* Oh?
Blobfish (Sad): Ooh well, you brought someone else
MC (Happy): Well, I can take you with me too!
Blobfish (Wondering): Naah, only two can pass at once
MC (Confused): ...
- Reject
	MC (Normal): Sorry, already made a promise
	Blobfish (Sad): Awww
	Blobfish (Wondering): Gooood luuck, I'll find my way!
- Accept
	MC (Normal): Will you be fine on your own?
	Halluci (Sad): I....can try....
	Blobfish (Happy): Yaaay!
	Blobfish (Happiness): Let's find some good homes
	MC (Happy): Sure!
	[signal arg="Delete"]
